  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "1a0a993f-f436-469e-a951-14d2d90964bc",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# 08 Konstruktory\n**autor: Erik Kr\u00E1l ekral@utb.cz**\n\n---\n\nPro zvl\u00E1dnut\u00ED p\u0159edm\u011Btu pot\u0159ebujete v\u011Bd\u011Bt jak definovat konstruktory s parametry ve struktur\u00E1ch a t\u0159\u00EDd\u00E1ch. "
    },
    {
      "id": "ec6698e4-501e-45c6-91d3-452bdad2a444",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Na n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDch p\u0159\u00EDkladech si probereme jednotliv\u00E9 p\u0159\u00EDkazy. "
    },
    {
      "id": "750c0c66-2ac4-4b4a-8312-5ff0a57516de",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Nejprve si definujeme t\u0159\u00EDdu pro obdeln\u00EDk, kter\u00FD bude m\u00EDt definovan\u00E9 rozm\u011Bry \u0060a\u0060 a \u0060b\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0cd3cfc-4994-41b7-bd44-9a0832fb7412",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Obdelnik\n{\n    public double a;\n    public double b;\n}",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 41
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5869b038-afc5-41a6-ae53-04c24d99a89b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Prom\u011Bnnou typu \u0060Obdelnik\u0060 vytvo\u0159\u00EDme n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED zp\u016Fsobem, p\u0159ed prvn\u00EDm pou\u017Eit\u00EDm mus\u00EDme p\u0159i\u0159adit v\u0161em field\u016Fm hodnoty."
    },
    {
      "id": "63a66966-1f4d-41c5-915a-1938b76df964",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Obdelnik o1 = new Obdelnik();\no1.a = 2.0;\no1.b = 3.0;\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o1.a} x {o1.b}\u0022);\n// vypise \u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery 2 x 3\u0022",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik ma rozmery 2 x 3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 42
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c0b64394-4198-42ea-84f4-5c45ddab0936",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Do t\u0159\u00EDdy m\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159idat konstruktor s jedn\u00EDm nebo v\u00EDce parametry (nebo i bez parametru) a v n\u011Bm nastavit v\u00FDchoz\u00ED hodnoty field\u016F. Konstruktor je metoda, kter\u00E1 nem\u00E1 \u017E\u00E1dn\u00FD n\u00E1vratov\u00FD typ ani \u0060void\u0060 a jmenuje se stejn\u011B jako struktura."
    },
    {
      "id": "53644722-22bc-4490-bb55-1b4ad342b8e1",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Obdelnik\n{\n    public double a;\n    public double b;\n    \n    public Obdelnik(double a, double b)\n    {   \n        this.a = a;\n        this.b = b;\n    }\n}",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 43
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c51d2aa0-ac8d-480c-b9f0-d2155f9b3869",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Konstruktoru potom m\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159edat jako argumenty v\u00FDchoz\u00ED hodnoty field\u016F, nap\u0159\u00EDklad pomoc\u00ED v\u00FDrazu \u0060new Obdelnik(2.0, 3.0)\u0060 m\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159i\u0159adit field\u016Fm \u0060a\u0060 a \u0060b\u0060 v\u00FDchoz\u00ED hodnoty \u00602.0 \u0060 respektive \u00603.0 \u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "737ba370-efda-4225-98ed-67d2d9c7cf7d",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Obdelnik o1 = new Obdelnik(2.0, 3.0);\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o1.a} x {o1.b}\u0022);\n// vypise \u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery 2 x 3\u0022",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik ma rozmery 2 x 3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6dcceeef-f33b-4fa3-a4e7-72eff981ae50",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud argumenty nezad\u00E1me, tak kompil\u00E1tor zahl\u00E1s\u00ED u t\u0159\u00EDdy chybu."
    },
    {
      "id": "a819fa87-28ff-4fbe-b7be-d21b61d6d9b4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Obdelnik o1 = new Obdelnik();\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o1.a} x {o1.b}\u0022);\n// Error: No overload for \u0027Obdelnik\u0027 takes 0 arguments",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Error: (1,19): error CS7036: There is no argument given that corresponds to the required parameter \u0027a\u0027 of \u0027Obdelnik.Obdelnik(double, double)\u0027\r\n(1,19): error CS7036: There is no argument given that corresponds to the required parameter \u0027a\u0027 of \u0027Obdelnik.Obdelnik(double, double)\u0027",
          "isError": true,
          "errorName": "Error",
          "errorStackTrace": "(1,19): error CS7036: There is no argument given that corresponds to the required parameter \u0027a\u0027 of \u0027Obdelnik.Obdelnik(double, double)\u0027"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a232faa9-2781-4fae-a795-7a7c608bfb6b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Ve t\u0159\u00EDd\u011B m\u016F\u017Eeme m\u00EDt i v\u00EDce konstruktor\u016F s r\u016Fzn\u00FDmi parametry nebo bez parametr\u016F."
    },
    {
      "id": "1f34ec5d-c438-4f61-a4f8-bb7b2d4d3950",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Obdelnik\n{\n    public double a;\n    public double b;\n    \n    public Obdelnik()\n    {   \n        a = 1.0;\n        b = 1.0;\n    }\n\n    public Obdelnik(double a, double b)\n    {   \n        this.a = a;\n        this.b = b;\n    }\n}\n\nObdelnik o1 = new Obdelnik();\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o1.a} x {o1.b}\u0022);\n\nObdelnik o2 = new Obdelnik(2.0, 3.0);\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o2.a} x {o2.b}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik ma rozmery 1 x 1\nObdelnik ma rozmery 2 x 3\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 48
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa7de37c-b2cc-43cc-8107-49a48cfd06e0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Konstruktor u struktury"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d4980e6-d682-47de-9c73-1a64ad557eae",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Struktura se od t\u0159\u00EDdy z hlediska konstruktor\u016F li\u0161\u00ED v tom, \u017Ee v\u017Edy m\u00E1 **defaultn\u00ED konstruktor** bez parametr\u016F a je jedno jestli nadefinujeme nebo nenadefinujeme konstruktor bez parametr\u016F.\n\nDefaultn\u00ED konstruktor nastav\u00ED hodnoty na defaultn\u00ED hodnoty, kdy v p\u0159\u00EDpad\u011B typu \u0060double\u0060 je defaultn\u00ED hodnota \u00600.0\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "db216dc1-2396-499f-aa5f-7c9b91e3c674",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "struct Obdelnik\n{\n    public double a;\n    public double b;\n    \n    // Vzdy tu bude defaultni konstruktor bez parametru\n    \n    public Obdelnik()\n    {   \n        a = 1.0;\n        b = 1.0;\n\n        Console.WriteLine(\u0022Muj konstruktor bez parametru!\u0022);\n    }\n\n    public Obdelnik(double a, double b)\n    {   \n        this.a = a;\n        this.b = b;\n\n        Console.WriteLine(\u0022Muj konstruktor s parametry!\u0022);\n    }\n}\n\nObdelnik o1; // Vola se defaultni konstruktor\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o1.a} x {o1.b}\u0022);\n\nObdelnik o2 = new Obdelnik(); // Vola se muj konstruktor bez parametru\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o2.a} x {o2.b}\u0022);\n\nObdelnik o3 = new Obdelnik(2, 3); // Vola se konstruktor s parametry\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o3.a} x {o3.b}\u0022);\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik ma rozmery 0 x 0\nMuj konstruktor bez parametru!\nObdelnik ma rozmery 1 x 1\nMuj konstruktor s parametry!\nObdelnik ma rozmery 2 x 3\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 62
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a189451f-b044-4f29-b4e0-e6015be70d45",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "V p\u0159\u00EDpad\u011B pole struktur se vol\u00E1 **defaultn\u00ED konstruktor**."
    },
    {
      "id": "dbc46016-31df-40fd-879d-26829b93869d",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Obdelnik[] pole = new Obdelnik[3]; // Vola se defaultni konstruktor pro kazdy prvek pole\n\nforeach (var obdelnik in pole)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {obdelnik.a} x {obdelnik.b}\u0022);\n}\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik ma rozmery 0 x 0\nObdelnik ma rozmery 0 x 0\nObdelnik ma rozmery 0 x 0\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "eeb843cf-6da2-48b5-9d93-90bb2501810d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Kl\u00ED\u010Dov\u00E9 slovo required a Object Initializer"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f5762f6-31d9-4be7-9af1-fdbfcacaae06",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Object inicializer\n\nObject Initializer p\u0159edstavuje z\u00E1pis ve slo\u017Een\u00FDch z\u00E1vork\u00E1ch ve kter\u00E9m m\u016F\u017Eeme voliteln\u011B inicializovat \u010Dlensk\u00E9 prvky.\n\nM\u016F\u017Eeme ho kombinovat s konstruktorem."
    },
    {
      "id": "8548bb96-8f0b-4f7e-934c-7fdae9f26d94",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Obdelnik\n{\n    public int id;\n    public double a;\n    public double b;\n\n    public Obdelnik(double a, double b)\n    {\n        this.a = a;\n        this.b = b;\n    }\n}\n\n// Object initializer\n// Voliteln\u011B m\u016F\u017Eu nastavit hodnotu id a dal\u0161\u00EDch field\u016F p\u0159\u00EDmo p\u0159i vytv\u00E1\u0159en\u00ED instance\nObdelnik obdelnik = new Obdelnik(2.0, 3.0) { id = 1 }; \n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik id={obdelnik.id} ma rozmery {obdelnik.a} x {obdelnik.b}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik id=1 ma rozmery 2 x 3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "57675c3a-efd6-413a-a605-786cc2334fc7",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Alternativou pro konstruktor je kl\u00ED\u010Dov\u00E9 slovo \u0060required\u0060 kter\u00E9 ur\u010Duje, \u017Ee hodnota fieldu nebo property mus\u00ED b\u00FDt p\u0159i\u0159azen\u00E1 v **object initializ\u00E9ru**."
    },
    {
      "id": "33046184-d380-44b3-b446-bd5ebdc935f3",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Obdelnik\n{\n    public int id;\n    public required double a;\n    public required double b;\n}\n\n// a a b je required, musi byt nastaveno\nObdelnik obdelnik = new Obdelnik() { a = 2.0, b = 3.0 }; \n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik id = {obdelnik.id} ma rozmery {obdelnik.a} x {obdelnik.b}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Obdelnik id = 0 ma rozmery 2 x 3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "13d0391b-b80f-4959-88c8-611a2db56eb9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "---\n## P\u0159\u00EDklady"
    },
    {
      "id": "db01a2df-48b7-4ce6-9831-0af376f7b392",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "\n### 1. P\u0159\u00EDklad na pou\u017Eit\u00ED kl\u00ED\u010Dov\u00E9ho slova required\n\nV n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm p\u0159\u00EDkladu nem\u016F\u017Ee m\u00EDt t\u0159\u00EDda Student konstruktor s parametry, proto\u017Ee ji pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1 Entity Framework."
    },
    {
      "id": "ccabda12-0391-490f-8018-6bb9bb633ea9",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "#r \u0022nuget: Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite\u0022",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInstalled Packages\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EMicrosoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite, 9.0.10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 71
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8f70ae42-0e44-49de-a1a8-ae5fedcc6c35",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;\n\nclass Student\n{\n    public int Id {get; set;}\n    public required string Name {get; set;}\n    public required int Age {get; set;}\n\n    // nemuzu mit konstruktor s parametry pokud chci pouzivat EF Core\n}\n\nclass SchoolContext : DbContext\n{\n    public DbSet\u003CStudent\u003E Students { get; set; }\n\n    protected override void OnConfiguring(DbContextOptionsBuilder options)\n        =\u003E options.UseSqlite(\u0022Data Source=school.db\u0022);\n}\n\n\nusing (var db = new SchoolContext())\n{\n    db.Database.EnsureDeleted();\n    db.Database.EnsureCreated();\n\n    var student1 = new Student { Name = \u0022Jan Novak\u0022, Age = 20 };\n    var student2 = new Student { Name = \u0022Alena Vesela\u0022, Age = 21 };\n\n    db.Students.AddRange(student1, student2);\n\n    db.SaveChanges();\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "98e2d024-4f62-4593-b5bf-35bef8ad843c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "using (var db = new SchoolContext())\n{\n    foreach (var s in db.Students)\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine($\u0022Student {s.Id}: {s.Name}, {s.Age} let\u0022);\n    }\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Student 1: Jan Novak, 20 let\nStudent 2: Alena Vesela, 21 let\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 78
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9b2a1009-ed63-42cf-a6cd-ec36556886c2",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### 2. P\u0159\u00EDklad: Komplexn\u00ED \u010D\u00EDslo"
    },
    {
      "id": "dea78b94-72e8-4c89-8eb9-53af177a316c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "struct Komplexni\n{\n    public double re;\n    public double im;\n\n    public Komplexni(double re, double im)\n    {\n        this.re = re;\n        this.im = im;\n    }\n}\n\nKomplexni c1 = new Komplexni(2.0, 3.0);\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Komplexni cislo ma hodnotu {c1.re} \u002B {c1.im}i\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d1886dc-1695-496d-81bb-7efd5f4306fd",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### 3. P\u0159\u00EDklad: Obdeln\u00EDk"
    },
    {
      "id": "78927288-a92a-4e17-8c30-bf141905e54b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "struct Obdelnik\n{\n    public double a;\n    public double b;\n\n    public Obdelnik(double a, double b)\n    {\n        this.a = a;\n        this.b = b;\n    }\n}\n\nObdelnik o1 = new Obdelnik(2.0, 3.0);\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obdelnik ma rozmery {o1.a} x {o1.b}\u0022);"
    }
  ]
}